      "writtenOn": "2024-07-19T21:05:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This path also ends up getting hit if the connection was absent when the command was queued. I have reason to believe we\u0027re hitting this path in TAST when the test is calling console commands while the PD connection is still stabilizing.\n\nI don\u0027t think the callers are widely enforcing this; for instance our console commands do not check --this is really the only line of defense. I would propose adding an additional check at the start of `public_api_block()` to reliably bail out (and do so quicker)",
